, "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16005$B0C2954F-D308-4A47-8CE5-28E7D9F11E88", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "38dd3c4ace566ad51b711586f6b2e11a392c595c", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1709, "id": "Q1709"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16005$AD8FB299-6DC2-487D-B271-A56C1519084A", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "8e0abffddec0903ecca01af48d389b0fbf3384ab", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1772, "id": "Q1772"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16005$91103CE2-B278-4321-95F2-F025E741BB44", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "25176b513f2f538153e5cdca588409932451f34f", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1772, "id": "Q1772"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16005$3D9C701B-5D32-43A0-826B-62F2B4FF82E0", "rank": "normal"}], "P19": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P19", "hash": "31b3848839d69d85129a338d734326c099e2be1b", "datavalue": {"value": "You went down these stairs. On the right were bulkheads and then some good tables. Over here was the bullpen, where you just could have a beer. Beyond that was the bar. We're sitting, and we're talking, and all of a sudden there's a scuffle at the bar. The doors backstage were like saloon doors. I saw Morris's brother lean into one, and of course the door went with him. Apparently some guy had ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16005$F487A1B1-C2F7-42F5-8F10-5E0A5CCB7C96", "rank": "normal"}]}}